    "body": "## What's new in v0.6.0\n- **Gentler result cards:** the bold red/green blocks are gone — results now use a muted colour accent + a faint tint, de-shouted wording, and inherit the chat text colour (works on light or dark themes).\n- **Critical-injury announcement (optional):** when auto-rolled damage scores a crit (two or more 6s), the module rolls the system's matching critical injury table (head or body by hit location) and posts **which** injury resulted. It is **not** added to the character sheet — apply it manually if you want. Toggle: *Announce the critical injury on a crit* (on by default).\n\n## Update\nManifest URL (auto-updates): `https://github.com/Vec97/cpred-evasion-workflow/releases/latest/download/module.json` — requires socketlib; reload the world after updating.\n"
  },
