    "body": "## What's new in v0.5.0\n- **Autofire auto-damage:** autofire hits now automatically roll & apply damage — `2d6 × (attack − autofire DV)`, capped at the weapon's autofire multiplier. Falls back to the manual button if the autofire DV can't be resolved.\n- **Multiple targets:** if several tokens are targeted, each gets its own Evade/Tank prompt (or auto-melee) and its own damage resolution against the shared attack roll.\n\nAimed shots (from v0.4.0) remain supported. Grenades/rockets and thrown weapons still fall back to the manual *Roll Damage* button.\n\n## Install / update\nManifest URL (auto-updates to the latest release):\n```\nhttps://github.com/Vec97/cpred-evasion-workflow/releases/latest/download/module.json\n```\nRequires **socketlib**. Reload the world after updating.\n"
